 - `writeReport` accepts `format` argument to enable additional exporters (HTML, CSV) later.
 - CLI parsing accommodates further evaluation subcommands (e.g., `frai eval bias`).
 
+## Threshold Gating
+Evaluation reports support optional thresholds to gate CI/CD pipelines on metric quality. Pass `thresholds` to `generateReport` with a map of metric IDs to minimum scores (e.g., `{ exact_match: 0.9 }`). The report includes a top-level `passed` field and `thresholds` array showing results. Metrics without scores fail their thresholds. CLI support via `--threshold metric=min` (repeatable).
+
 ## Follow-up Tasks
 1. Integrate real toxicity/bias models once provider abstraction is implemented (Phase 0 → Providers milestone).
 2. Extend datasets loader to support configurable schema mapping.
